{"id":1092,"chapter_id":1,"scene_id":112,"steps":[{"step":1,"speaker":"海拉","content":"呼——呼——我可从没想过，就我们这点人，居然要面对这种怪物。","voice":["vo_cgplot_1092001"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_01","style":1,"background":122,"log_type":1},{"step":2,"speaker":"海拉","content":"真是害人不浅，泰德那家伙——*文明*，他也躲得太远了吧？！就那么怕被人寻仇吗？","voice":["vo_cgplot_1092002"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_01","style":1,"background":122,"log_type":1},{"step":3,"speaker":"赫卡蒂","content":"这么一来就结束了，武装医师被打败，现在没人会妨碍我们。","voice":["vo_cgplot_1092003"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_01","style":1,"background":122,"log_type":1},{"step":4,"speaker":"赫卡蒂","content":"局长，进诊所吧。","voice":["vo_cgplot_1092004"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_01","style":1,"background":122,"log_type":1},{"step":5,"speaker":"选项","options":["……这就来","等我一下"],"jump":[6,9],"style":6,"background":122,"log_type":1},{"step":6,"content":"你最后看了一眼倒在地上的“怪物”，或者说，“布兰德”。它的瞳孔在逐渐涣散，嘴里却还喃喃着什么。","style":3,"background":122,"log_type":1},{"step":7,"speaker":"“布兰德”","content":"我会……救……你们……我…………会…………","voice":["vo_cgplot_1092007"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_01","style":1,"background":122,"log_type":1},{"step":9,"content":"你稍微靠近了些，最后看了一眼倒在地上的“布兰德”。它的瞳孔逐渐涣散，嘴里还在喃喃着什么。","style":3,"background":122,"log_type":1},{"step":10,"speaker":"“布兰德”","content":"我会……救……你们……我…………会…………","voice":["vo_cgplot_1092010"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_01","style":1,"background":122,"log_type":1},{"step":11,"content":"有那么一瞬间，他身上有某种，和禁闭者相似的气息。","style":3,"background":122,"log_type":1},{"step":12,"content":"铛——哒——哒哒哒——","style":3,"background":122,"log_type":1},{"step":13,"content":"一个一指长的金属圆柱体滚到你们附近，渐渐停了下来。呲——的一声，从两端孔洞中喷出了异样的气体。","style":3,"background":122,"log_type":1},{"step":14,"speaker":"海拉","content":"这是！？别吸气，${PlayerName}！别——","voice":["vo_cgplot_1092014"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_01","style":1,"background":122,"log_type":1},{"step":15,"content":"她脸色铁青向你扑来，可还没碰到你，就被某种巨大的力量挥开，然后立刻没了音。","style":3,"background":122,"log_type":1},{"step":16,"speaker":"选项","options":["抓住海拉","赶快回避"],"jump":[17,19],"style":6,"background":122,"log_type":1},{"step":17,"content":"你想伸手，却发现手并没有抬到应有的高度。你的视线开始摇摆，然后突然下坠。","style":3,"background":122,"log_type":1},{"step":19,"content":"你想避开那可疑的气体，腿却没能及时跟上重心后退。你径直向后跌去，却连摔倒在地的疼痛感都被剥夺。","style":3,"background":122,"log_type":1},{"step":20,"speaker":"赫卡蒂","content":"……神经……毒……素…………","voice":["vo_cgplot_1092020"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_01","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":21,"content":"你想呼喊，唇舌却不听使唤，仿佛意识与身体的一切都切断了联系，只有眼前模糊动摇的画面是你最后能抓住的浮木。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":22,"speaker":"？？","content":"值班结束了……布兰德，睡个好觉。","voice":["vo_cgplot_1092022"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_01","style":1,"background":50106,"log_type":1},{"step":23,"speaker":"？？","content":"以及，欢迎来到彼岸……走狗局长。","voice":["vo_cgplot_1092023"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_01","style":1,"background":50106,"log_type":1}]}